desktop.an_older_copy_of_comic_archiver:
An older copy of Comic Archiver is still on this computer, in
{folder}

Remove it? Your sign-in and saved episodes stay.

desktop.comic_archiver_cannot_find_its_l:
Comic Archiver cannot find its library folder any more:
{folder}

Close Comic Archiver, put the folder back where it was, and open Comic Archiver again.

Comic Archiver cannot find its library folder:
{folder}

It was renamed, moved or deleted. Choose the folder where it is now.

desktop.comic_archiver_cannot_open_the_f:
Comic Archiver cannot open the folder it saves to:
{folder}

If it is on a drive that is not connected, choose No, connect the drive and open Comic Archiver again.

Save to the standard folder instead?
{standard}

desktop.comic_archiver_cannot_use_becaus:
Comic Archiver cannot use "{root}" because this folder in it leads somewhere else (a junction):
{folder}

Comic Archiver never makes one there. Delete that junction, or choose another folder.

desktop.comic_archiver_cant_reach_these_:
Comic Archiver can't reach these library folders, so it can't sign out there:
{folders}

Connect the drives they're on, then uninstall again.

desktop.comic_archiver_cant_reach_this_l:
Comic Archiver can't reach this library folder, so it can't sign out there:
{folders}

Connect the drive it's on, then uninstall again.

desktop.comic_archiver_is_removed_from_y:
Comic Archiver is removed from your applications menu. It is signed out of every site, except in:
{folders}

Your saved episodes are still in
{library}

desktop.comic_archiver_is_signed_out_of:
Comic Archiver is signed out of every site and removed from your applications menu.

Your saved episodes are still in
{library}

desktop.save_to_this_folder_from_now:
Save to this folder from now on?

{new}

Nothing is moved: episodes already saved stay where they are, in
{old}

The download then saves everything again in the new folder, and the dashboard counts only what is there. To keep what is saved instead, choose No, close Comic Archiver, move the whole folder
{root}
to the new place, then open Comic Archiver and choose the folder you moved.

desktop.this_folder_already_holds_a_comi:
This folder already holds a Comic Archiver library. Use it from now on?

{new}

Nothing is moved: episodes saved in the folder used until now stay there, in
{old}

The dashboard then counts only what is saved in this folder.

window.signed_out_of_except_in_these:
Signed out of {site}, except in these library folders, which Comic Archiver can't reach:
{folders}
Connect the drives they're on, choose each folder using the edit icon beside the library folder on the dashboard, and sign out there.

window.signed_out_of_except_in_this:
Signed out of {site}, except in this library folder, which Comic Archiver can't reach:
{folders}
Connect the drive it's on, choose the folder using the edit icon beside the library folder on the dashboard, and sign out there.
